00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:44.811
How did this happen, man?

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.746
Get the fuck...

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:48.414
Y'all gonna vote for the dude
that's gonna

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:51.017
